bourg may be small, but it’s packed with charm. Known for its medieval castles, lush countryside, and role as a European hub, this tiny yet mighty nation offers a unique blend of history and modernity. ",[],"ltr",{"type":88,"text":93,"spans":94,"direction":91},"Got a parcel to post to Luxembourg? Whether you’re delivering a gift to friends in Esch-sur-Alzette or fulfilling a business order to Differdange, our international courier services will get your items there.  ",[],{"type":88,"text":96,"spans":97,"direction":91},"Every delivery includes full tracking and up to £20 parcel cover as standard, so you can enjoy peace of mind every step of the way. Plus, you can also send parcels to Cyprus, ship to Latvia and beyond. We deliver to 200+ countries and territories, making it easier for you to extend your reach outside the UK.",[98,105,107,112],{"start":99,"end":100,"type":101,"data":102},151,173,"hyperlink",{"link_type":36,"url":103,"target":104},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fcyprus","_blank",{"start":99,"end":100,"type":106},"strong",{"start":108,"end":109,"type":101,"data":110},175,189,{"link_type":36,"url":111,"target":104},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Flatvia",{"start":108,"end":109,"type":106},"card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":116,"version":31,"items":117,"primary":133,"id":142,"slice_type":143,"slice_label":46},"2ColumnTableButton",[118,121,124,127,130],{"Col1Content":119,"Col2Content":120},"250g","£8.89",{"Col1Content":122,"Col2Content":123},"500g","£9.59",{"Col1Content":125,"Col2Content":126},"1kg","£10.89",{"Col1Content":128,"Col2Content":129},"2kg","£11.79",{"Col1Content":131,"Col2Content":132},"5kg+","£33.69",{"SectionTitle":134,"SectionSubtitle":135,"Col1Header":136,"Col2Header":137,"InformationTableButtonUrl":138,"InformationTableButtonText":141,"isTableShort":20},"How much does it cost to send a parcel to Luxembourg?","Postage to Luxembourg depends on its weight. See how cheap it can be to post up to 15kg to Luxembourg based on popular parcel weights:","Weight","Price",{"link_type":36,"key":139,"url":140},"df3defb0-0e00-41ad-992f-27aafdadffc6","luxembourg.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send","Send a parcel","information_table$f82345cd-ef2a-46c0-baee-2cacc12cf155","information_table",{"variation":145,"version":31,"items":146,"primary":148,"id":208,"slice_type":114,"slice_label":46},"cardNoImageWithCta",[147],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":149,"CardText":150,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":206,"IsEco":20},"Public holidays in Luxembourg",[151,154,160,165,170,174,179,184,188,192,197,201],{"type":88,"text":152,"spans":153,"direction":91},"While we aim to deliver parcels within 8-11 working days, public holidays in Luxembourg can occasionally impact our timings. To help reduce the chance of delays, we recommend sending your parcels earlier around the following dates:",[],{"type":155,"text":156,"spans":157,"direction":91},"list-item","New Year’s Day – 01\u002F01\u002F2026",[158],{"start":66,"end":159,"type":106},14,{"type":155,"text":161,"spans":162,"direction":91},"Easter Monday – 06\u002F04\u002F2026",[163],{"start":66,"end":164,"type":106},15,{"type":155,"text":166,"spans":167,"direction":91},"Labour Day - 01\u002F05\u002F2026",[168],{"start":66,"end":169,"type":106},10,{"type":155,"text":171,"spans":172,"direction":91},"Ascension Day – 14\u002F05\u002F2026",[173],{"start":66,"end":164,"type":106},{"type":155,"text":175,"spans":176,"direction":91},"Whit Monday – 25\u002F05\u002F2026",[177],{"start":66,"end":178,"type":106},13,{"type":155,"text":180,"spans":181,"direction":91},"National Day - 23\u002F06\u002F2026",[182],{"start":66,"end":183,"type":106},12,{"type":155,"text":185,"spans":186,"direction":91},"Assumption Day - 15\u002F08\u002F2026",[187],{"start":66,"end":164,"type":106},{"type":155,"text":189,"spans":190,"direction":91},"Liberation Day - 10\u002F09\u002F2026",[191],{"start":66,"end":164,"type":106},{"type":155,"text":193,"spans":194,"direction":91},"All Saints' Day – 01\u002F11\u002F2026",[195],{"start":66,"end":196,"type":106},17,{"type":155,"text":198,"spans":199,"direction":91},"Christmas Day – 25\u002F12\u002F2026",[200],{"start":66,"end":159,"type":106},{"type":155,"text":202,"spans":203,"direction":91},"Boxing Day - 26\u002F12\u002F2026",[204],{"start":66,"end":205,"type":106},11,{"link_type":207},"Any","card$ccd53f1d-7d09-451b-ba0d-c8f0f52f188f",{"variation":210,"version":31,"items":211,"primary":273,"id":283,"slice_type":284,"slice_label":46},"3Column",[212,234,253],{"Title":213,"Description":218,"Image":222,"Label":46,"UrlText":216,"Url":230,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":233,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[214],{"type":215,"text":216,"spans":217},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[219],{"type":88,"text":220,"spans":221,"direction":91},"For a convenient ParcelShop drop off, book your delivery online and choose from 9,000+ ParcelShops near you. Print your postage label at home or using our Print in-store devices for free. We’re also in selected Post Offices if you prefer to book with us in person.",[],{"dimensions":223,"alt":225,"copyright":46,"url":226,"id":227,"edit":228},{"width":78,"height":224},670,"Post Office ParcelShop","luxembourg.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F19e68f6f-ac0d-4bce-b8c7-db5227dbfa2f_Option+1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C448%2C8192%2C5489&w=1000&h=670","ZgKfWhAAACkAd80m",{"x":66,"y":229,"zoom":67,"background":68},448,{"link_type":36,"key":231,"url":232},"e7793b01-7714-4c84-b49e-e3050a43f44c","\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":207},{"Title":235,"Description":239,"Image":243,"Label":46,"UrlText":237,"Url":249,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":252,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[236],{"type":215,"text":237,"spans":238},"Lockers",[],[240],{"type":88,"text":241,"spans":242,"direction":91},"Book your delivery online and visit your most convenient Evri Locker in locations across the UK. Print your label, scan your barcode on arrival, and place your parcel in a secure, available Locker ready for collection. ",[],{"dimensions":244,"alt":245,"copyright":46,"url":246,"id":247,"edit":248},{"width":78,"height":79},"Woman using terminal on parcel locker while holding cardboard box","luxembourg.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F37e4506e-49f5-44f8-9006-d1db89f71b10_lockerimage1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=1%2C0%2C4997%2C3333&w=1000&h=667","Yh4IoRIAACgA8w_Y",{"x":67,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"link_type":36,"key":250,"url":251},"6b8b1d6d-8a36-4997-b718-4322fa7bb19f","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":207},{"Title":254,"Description":258,"Image":262,"Label":46,"UrlText":256,"Url":269,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":272,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[255],{"type":215,"text":256,"spans":257},"Courier collection",[],[259],{"type":88,"text":260,"spans":261,"direction":91},"Prefer a doorstep collection? Book one of our local couriers to come to you. Choose a day that suits your schedule and a location - whether from your home or office. We’ll give you a 1-hour collection window so you know when to expect us.",[],{"dimensions":263,"alt":264,"copyright":46,"url":265,"id":266,"edit":267},{"width":78,"height":79},"An older woman hands a parcel to a courier for collection. The courier is taking a photo.","luxembourg.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6ou1pbqstJ9-cSH_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10245.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=80%2C0%2C7652%2C5104&w=1000&h=667","Z6ou1pbqstJ9-cSH",{"x":268,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},80,{"link_type":36,"key":270,"url":271},"b5155cd1-7f69-4fdd-8770-3668ab4ef2f4","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":207},{"SectionTitle":274,"SectionDescription":279,"theme":46},[275],{"type":276,"text":277,"spans":278,"direction":91},"heading2","How to send a parcel to Luxembourg ",[],[280],{"type":88,"text":281,"spans":282,"direction":91},"With Evri, you have three convenient ways to send your parcels to Luxembourg:",[],"article_link_module$380d507a-5f74-4888-80cd-627d9379f8f9","article_link_module",{"variation":286,"version":31,"items":287,"primary":288,"id":301,"slice_type":114,"slice_label":46},"default-slice",[],{"CardImage":289,"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":295,"CardText":296,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":300,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":290,"alt":291,"copyright":46,"url":292,"id":293,"edit":294},{"width":78,"height":79},"A landscape view of a bridge crossing a valley in Luxembourg with a train crossing and lots of tree foliage.","luxembourg.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaV0pznNYClf9o0rT_Luxembourg-1-.jpg?auto=format,compress","aV0pznNYClf9o0rT",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"How long does it take to send a parcel to Luxembourg?",[297],{"type":88,"text":298,"spans":299,"direction":91},"The estimated delivery time for parcels sent to Luxembourg is 8-11 working days using our standard service.",[],{"link_type":207},"card$235abab9-ab29-457d-b063-0ca749dac21d",{"variation":286,"version":31,"items":303,"primary":305,"id":338,"slice_type":114,"slice_label":46},[304],{},{"CardImage":306,"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":314,"CardText":315,"ButtonText":335,"ButtonUrl":336,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":307,"alt":309,"copyright":46,"url":310,"id":311,"edit":312},{"width":78,"height":308},665,"An Evri Courier gathering multiple parcels from their car to deliver to their destination","luxembourg.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDXpbqstJ9-cfC_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3497.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6pDXpbqstJ9-cfC",{"x":66,"y":313,"zoom":67,"background":68},8,"Send multiple parcels to Luxembourg",[316,322,329,332],{"type":88,"text":317,"spans":318,"direction":91},"Whether you’re sending multiple gifts or running an online business, our Bulk Integration tool is perfect for managing larger shipments anywhere. ",[319],{"start":320,"end":321,"type":106},73,94,{"type":323,"text":324,"spans":325,"direction":91},"o-list-item","Log in or create an Evri account and head to our Bulk Integrations tool using our international.evri.com website. Click ‘Link Account’ to connect your marketplace accounts like eBay, Etsy, Amazon, Shopify, or upload via CSV file. ",[326],{"start":327,"end":328,"type":106},82,104,{"type":323,"text":330,"spans":331,"direction":91},"Package and book your items online and print off your postage label at home or in-store with our free Print in ParcelShop device ",[],{"type":323,"text":333,"spans":334,"direction":91},"Drop off your parcels at any of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers, or schedule a courier collection. ",[],"View integrations",{"link_type":36,"key":337,"url":38},"db48d55a-9422-43c6-be4a-c793a4cf5b11","card$76879935-3511-477c-94a2-9292bebef45d",{"variation":340,"version":31,"items":341,"primary":422,"id":425,"slice_type":426,"slice_label":46},"listComponent",[342,361,373,386,398,410],{"title":343,"content":344,"icon":354},"Regular tracking updates",[345],{"type":88,"text":346,"spans":347,"direction":91},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[348,353],{"start":349,"end":350,"type":101,"data":351},55,63,{"link_type":36,"url":352,"target":104},"\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":349,"end":350,"type":106},{"dimensions":355,"alt":357,"copyright":46,"url":358,"id":359,"edit":360},{"width":356,"height":356},40,"Phone icon","luxembourg.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":362,"content":363,"icon":367},"Parcel cover",[364],{"type":88,"text":365,"spans":366,"direction":91},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind",[],{"dimensions":368,"alt":369,"copyright":46,"url":370,"id":371,"edit":372},{"width":356,"height":356},"Money icon","luxembourg.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":374,"content":375,"icon":379},"Customs made easier",[376],{"type":88,"text":377,"spans":378,"direction":91},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":380,"alt":381,"copyright":46,"url":382,"id":383,"edit":384},{"width":356,"height":356},"Passport icon","luxembourg.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":385},"#fff",{"title":387,"content":388,"icon":392},"Flexible printing options",[389],{"type":88,"text":390,"spans":391,"direction":91},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":393,"alt":394,"copyright":46,"url":395,"id":396,"edit":397},{"width":356,"height":356},"Printer icon","luxembourg.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":385},{"title":399,"content":400,"icon":404},"Connect your marketplaces",[401],{"type":88,"text":402,"spans":403,"direction":91},"Connect your Evri account with eBay, Amazon, Etsy, Shopify, WooCommerce and more or upload a CSV to book multiple deliveries in one go. We'll even mark your orders as 'dispatched' and update your customers with tracking information",[],{"dimensions":405,"alt":406,"copyright":46,"url":407,"id":408,"edit":409},{"width":356,"height":356},"Laptop icon","luxembourg.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":411,"content":412,"icon":416},"Trusted by top UK brands",[413],{"type":88,"text":414,"spans":415,"direction":91},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo and Pretty Little Thing, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":417,"alt":418,"copyright":46,"url":419,"id":420,"edit":421},{"width":356,"height":356},"Success icon","luxembourg.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"theme":423,"title":424,"description":46},"standard","Why send parcels to Luxembourg with Evri","list_block$db4f6cbb-b3cd-4e39-bcbf-25235f67d61d","list_block",{"variation":145,"version":31,"items":428,"primary":430,"id":460,"slice_type":114,"slice_label":46},[429],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":431,"CardText":432,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":459,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send to Luxembourg",[433,442],{"type":88,"text":434,"spans":435,"direction":91},"While most items can be sent to Luxembourg, there are some restrictions you may need to be aware of. For more information, check our guide on what you can and can’t send. ",[436,441],{"start":437,"end":438,"type":101,"data":439},142,169,{"link_type":36,"url":43,"target":440},"_self",{"start":437,"end":438,"type":106},{"type":88,"text":443,"spans":444,"direction":91},"We also recommend following the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and UK Civil Aviation Authority to stay updated on what is accepted via airlines. ",[445,450,452,457],{"start":446,"end":447,"type":101,"data":448},32,64,{"link_type":36,"url":449,"target":104},"luxembourg.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F",{"start":446,"end":451,"type":106},65,{"start":453,"end":454,"type":101,"data":455},69,96,{"link_type":36,"url":456,"target":104},"luxembourg.html\u002F\u002Fwww.caa.co.uk\u002Fpassengers\u002FBefore-you-fly\u002FBaggage\u002FBanned-items\u002F",{"start":453,"end":458,"type":106},97,{"link_type":207},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":145,"version":31,"items":462,"primary":464,"id":489,"slice_type":114,"slice_label":46},[463],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":465,"CardText":466,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":488,"IsEco":20},"What address information do you need for Luxembourg?",[467,470,473,476,479,482,485],{"type":88,"text":468,"spans":469,"direction":91},"When booking your parcel online, simply enter the recipient’s postcode and we’ll provide different address options for you to choose from. ",[],{"type":88,"text":471,"spans":472,"direction":91},"We’ll make sure your label follows the correct format, ready for printing. All you need to do is check you have the correct details below before confirming your order: ",[],{"type":155,"text":474,"spans":475,"direction":91},"Recipient’s full name ",[],{"type":155,"text":477,"spans":478,"direction":91},"Street address ",[],{"type":155,"text":480,"spans":481,"direction":91},"City or town ",[],{"type":155,"text":483,"spans":484,"direction":91},"Postal code ",[],{"type":155,"text":486,"spans":487,"direction":91},"Country ",[],{"link_type":207},"card$6f66a640-ac28-4892-9a46-df43b1ecb324",{"variation":286,"version":31,"items":491,"primary":553,"id":555,"slice_type":556,"slice_label":46},[492,509,541],{"questionTitle":493,"questionBody":494},"Do I need to deal with customs when sending to Luxembourg?",[495,498,501],{"type":88,"text":496,"spans":497,"direction":91},"Some carriers ask you to print out a customs form and attach it to your parcel. Not with Evri. When you buy a parcel online, we automatically take all the information we need during checkout, making it even easier for you.",[],{"type":88,"text":499,"spans":500,"direction":91},"Be careful to fill in all the information correctly to make sure your parcel arrives at its destination as quickly as possible. If the information you provide is incorrect, it could result in your parcel being held at customs, with delays and charges outside of our control.",[],{"type":88,"text":502,"spans":503,"direction":91},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information.",[504,508],{"start":505,"end":451,"type":101,"data":506},30,{"link_type":36,"url":507,"target":104},"\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":505,"end":451,"type":106},{"questionTitle":510,"questionBody":511},"Is there import tax from the UK to Luxembourg?",[512,515,524,527,530,533,536],{"type":215,"text":513,"spans":514,"direction":91},"UK business or marketplace seller? ",[],{"type":88,"text":516,"spans":517,"direction":91},"If you’re an online seller sending goods up to the value of €150 and to a destination within the EU, you might want to use Import One Stop Shop (IOSS). IOSS deals with VAT charges at the point of sale. So, as well as making life simpler for you, it also benefits your recipient - there’ll be no surprise costs for your customer when they receive their goods. Check out our guide on sending parcels to Europe to find out more about IOSS.​",[518,523],{"start":519,"end":520,"type":101,"data":521},382,407,{"link_type":36,"url":522,"target":104},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Feurope",{"start":519,"end":520,"type":106},{"type":88,"text":525,"spans":526,"direction":91},"If you haven’t sold through a marketplace or if your parcel destination is outside the EU, remember to let your recipient know they may need to pay customs charges.",[],{"type":215,"text":528,"spans":529,"direction":91},"International standard delivery service",[],{"type":88,"text":531,"spans":532,"direction":91},"If you're using our international standard delivery service, your recipient may need to pay taxes and duties either before your items leave the UK or when the parcel reaches its destination. ",[],{"type":88,"text":534,"spans":535,"direction":91},"If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.",[],{"type":88,"text":502,"spans":537,"direction":91},[538,540],{"start":505,"end":451,"type":101,"data":539},{"link_type":36,"url":507,"target":104},{"start":505,"end":451,"type":106},{"questionTitle":542,"questionBody":543},"How can I track my parcel to Luxembourg?",[544],{"type":88,"text":545,"spans":546,"direction":91},"You can track your parcel every step of the way with our end-to-end tracking service. Both you and your recipient just need to enter your tracking number on our international tracking page to find out more. ",[547,552],{"start":548,"end":549,"type":101,"data":550},161,188,{"link_type":36,"url":551,"target":104},"luxembourg.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":548,"end":549,"type":106},{"title":554},"FAQs about sending parcels to Luxembourg from the UK","frequently_asked_questions$4c469f65-6730-41ff-8952-2d59d83cd157","frequently_asked_questions",[29,71,115,144,209,285,302,339,427,461,490],["Reactive",559],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":560,"$sclients":627,"$sglobal-basket-count":46,"$sglobal-user-postcode":630},{"abtasty":561,"accessibe":565,"appPromoBanner":568,"autoDivertUpdates":571,"awin":574,"bulkInternational":577,"bulkSendEnabled":580,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":583,"enableBasketCount":586,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":589,"euCustomsDuty":592,"groovyAdvert":595,"newInternationalSendFlow":598,"newinternationalpages":605,"oohPreferenceFlag":609,"opentel":612,"premium":615,"savedCards":618,"smallParcelSize":621,"yourPricesDrawer":624},{"_createdAt":562,"_updatedAt":563,"enabled":564},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",true,{"_createdAt":566,"_updatedAt":567,"enabled":564},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":569,"_updatedAt":570,"enabled":20},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_crea